  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ARM: Strengthening UK-Armenia fashion ties in the framework of Yerevan Fashion Week</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the 2nd Yerevan Fashion Week (YFW) with the focus on promoting the Armenian textile and fashion industry in the international fashion scene, is a great opportunity to stimulate economic growth within Armenia&#x2019;s fashion and textile industries, the sectors already predominantly driven by women and youth.</narrative>
  </description>
